# Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify) SPA fallback: the whole site is a single
# client-hydrated route (the game itself), so any path that isn't a literal
# static asset falls back to the 200.html shell. Real static files (JS/CSS/
# WASM/images) are matched first regardless of this rule -- see
# svelte.config.js `fallback: '200.html'`.
#
# NOTE: inert on Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (the current deploy
# target) -- Workers doesn't process _redirects, only Pages does. worker.js
# in this same directory does the equivalent routing for Workers.
/* /200.html 200
